          "pmid": 35848051,
          "citation": "PMID 35848051",
          "claim": "( 31 ) For the generation of suitable CaSR constructs, we used a WT human CaSR and a variant that had been modified by the insertion of a FLAG epitope tag DYKDDDDK in the receptor's VFT domain, between residues 371 and 372, ( 35 ) to permit quantitation of total and surface expression by ELISA.",
          "title": "Cell Surface Calcium-Sensing Receptor Heterodimers: Mutant Gene Dosage Affects Ca(2+) Sensing but Not G Protein Interaction",
